00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:54.600
neuropsychiatrist, we've got
Veteran Outreach Coordinators,

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.210
we've got everybody
who's trying to help them

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:58.870
and give them evidence based treatment.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:02.520
So I'm very proud of it, and
I'm happy to talk about it

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.070
'cause I think we're one
of the best kept secrets

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:07.210
in the nation, and we don't wanna be,

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:09.190
we wanna be full every time.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.626
