00:32:08.170 --> 00:32:10.530
And so, part of it, from my point of view,

00:32:10.530 --> 00:32:15.160
is education and letting people know that,

00:32:15.160 --> 00:32:18.640
yeah, it sucks what happened,

00:32:18.640 --> 00:32:21.900
but what you're suffering
