00:32:21.900 --> 00:32:23.090
we'll name it,

00:32:23.090 --> 00:32:26.463
and gotta diagnose it or talk about it,

00:32:26.463 --> 00:32:29.620
it's PTSD or depression
or substance use disorder

00:32:29.620 --> 00:32:30.903
and that we can treat.

00:32:32.030 --> 00:32:36.390
