00:32:36.390 --> 00:32:41.030
And you guys are the
best messengers we have.

00:32:41.030 --> 00:32:43.930
I mean, people who've
graduated from our program,

00:32:43.930 --> 00:32:47.380
they're our best PR to
tell other veterans,

00:32:47.380 --> 00:32:48.780
